<p>Tesla's AI Dominance Beyond Cybertruck to a Trillion-Dollar Vision</p>

<p>Shifting focus to Tesla—it’s more than a car company; it’s an AI powerhouse. Boasting exceptional AI engineers, top-notch infrastructure, fuck ton of data, and trillion dollars to burn through, Tesla’s impact extends beyond conventional car manufacturing.</p>

<p>At the core of all this stands a figure nearly as prominent in Indian households as Narendra Modi . While I steer clear of political viewpoints, I deeply admire this individual as a leader and visionary. With his flaws, his influence stems from straightforward thinking, extreme hard work, and an unyielding rebellious spirit.</p>



